      "body": "Question checkpoint following merged PR218: determine when the balanced quadratic biform block attains its one-below-full rank. Investigate whether its exact coefficient kernel is H0(C,O_C(a+1,-a-1)) on the primitive (2,2) curve, then audit smooth, singular, reducible and nonreduced cases. Source-pinned proof and finite controls are in progress; this initial commit claims no new theorem or exponent improvement. Existing F2 a6/a10 negative probes will be preserved rather than repeated. Open PR214 (consolidation) and PR219 (constant A4 compressions) were checked for overlap.",
